description.en:
·Tether X: Place a Tether X Token on this unit (the initiating unit) and a Tethered X Token on the target unit, indicating that the two units are in a Tether state. While in this state, the tethered unit cannot voluntarily move to a position beyond X grids from the initiating unit.
The Tether Tokens on both units are removed under any of the following conditions:
-	The initiating unit voluntarily moves to a position beyond X grids from the tethered unit;
-	The initiating unit is Penetrated;
-	Either the initiating unit or the tethered unit is forcibly moved, resulting in a distance greater than X between them.

